  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e4d5b9f9450d40f4595969ae59bbd522, type: 3}
  m_Name: TAPE_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KhoaHon.Notebook.TapeData
  id: TAPE_2
  title: "B\u0103ng #2 \u2014 c\u1EA1nh k\xE9t s\u1EAFt"
  titleEn: "Tape #2 \u2014 Beside the Safe"
  year: 6
  body: "Cu\u1ED9n b\u0103ng \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EA1nh k\xE9t s\u1EAFt trong Ph\xF2ng
    L\xE0m Vi\u1EC7c."
  bodyEn: Left next to the safe in the study.
  serif: 0
  clip: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - time: 0.5
    duration: 4.875
    text: "K\xE9t kh\xF3a s\u1ED1. \xD4ng Sterling vi\u1EBFt m\xE3 n\u1EB1m \u1EDF
      n\u0103m khai sinh c\u01A1 nghi\u1EC7p\u2026"
    textEn: "Combination safe. Sterling wrote the code is the year the fortune was
      born\u2026"
  - time: 5.775
    duration: 3.12
    text: "Em th\u1EED n\u0103m x\xE2y xong, 1924. Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
    textEn: I tried the year it was finished, 1924. Nothing.
  - time: 9.295
    duration: 2.405
    text: "(ti\u1EBFng ch\xECa kh\xF3a leng keng tr\xEAn tr\u1EA7n)"
    textEn: (keys jingling on the ceiling above)
  - time: 12.1
    duration: 2.2
    text: "B\xE0 ta \u1EDF ngay tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u em."
    textEn: She's right above me.
  - time: 14.700001
    duration: 5.5249996
    text: "\u0110\xEAm qua em th\u1EA5y b\xE0 ta \u0111\u1EE9ng \u1EDF chi\u1EBFu
      ngh\u1EC9 c\u1EA7u thang nh\xECn xu\u1ED1ng, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      xu\u1ED1ng."
    textEn: Last night I saw her on the landing, looking down. She didn't come down.
  - time: 20.625
    duration: 2.665
    text: "H\xECnh nh\u01B0 b\xE0 ta kh\xF4ng xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u01B0\u1EDBi
      n\xE0y."
    textEn: I don't think she can come down here.
  sanityRestore: 5
